sequenceDiagram
  participant J as Judge
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant API
  participant AG as Agent core
  participant LLM as LLM chain
  J->>UI: click prefilled example
  UI->>API: POST /run
  API->>AG: plan + tools
  AG->>LLM: prompt
  LLM-->>AG: structured output
  AG-->>API: result + trace
  API-->>UI: stream
  UI-->>J: result, citations, metrics
